<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-10-31T07:11:02.080Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 07:11:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi security forces have dismantled a drug-trafficking network, arresting 31 suspects, while Prime Minister Al-Zaidi has taken direct control of the intelligence service and is negotiating pipeline and oil export talks with Damascus. Iranian-linked attacks continue, including an Iranian strike that prompted a Navy corpsman and Marine Raiders to rescue French soldiers from a burning building, and a memorial was unveiled in Erbil for victims of the 2024 Iranian missile attack. Chinese missiles have been reported in Iraq, adding an external dimension to the conflict. 396 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPeGpueXA1cDBIbko1aU9NVlhFTGlONURzb0d1SmlUTF9PNFhnRE12dm1CTzJQSXNxaG1MT2M2cGlMNkdsVk9XSlFuQy1zcklkNUpfbHVqZ3FqSVBtVE95LTFKZVlRYm1XNnVEd01GMlRIMUpQc051bVhnZWY0WTI3SnNBa0tadTctemF1WXV2MWJUaG9uUnA2dnA2WmthX1MtdEpRY0szUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-?oc=5&quot;&gt;SyriacPress&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxORzg4ck0tMEFDWnBTanQyTTVsMmpPOUVCdzVCQzFWczJDSkFYSHAzVXBQbm5GcmZ5OVFqVzU5dlJLQVdybGI1THhlRUZsX2V0QU5kc0hFaXZINVItcjhwQk9YTFl6bkV3ejcySnZGa1lUSkx3SzNKS3BRaHRuTFpydXJzRnUtWDFQTlZud0Z6UUFFV21iNFVXN3ZfUThKN0EzZWNFX0F1VnNJZW4wOGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;ASHARQ AL-AWSAT English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOSmQ1ZEt4LVlkakxXUzltN3RuaUcwUE5TUEJKekQybXJJcng0ck9TekthUkNldjBSY2FTaFplcmtQLTFPWDdkRnp5RGhjaUh3VjQtTGM4OXlldWtYdFdKb0RrZ2dERS1DaDBYeXl3SmdkLTItVnpOWGxpSDFxZmJ3QTVMYmtCd2FsQjJCSFkyWWF0LTJjNDBnSEtaeHREanQwZ2psZHpTZVZfTFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Shipping Telegraph&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTE9BYjRtQzFNM2FITUdWUEV5WG54aDdTU190